or.com/Ragusa-attractions/Donnafugata-Castle-Castello-di-Donnafugata/d26225-a25316","https://www.thewomtravel.com/italy/sicily/ragusa/things-to-do-ragusa.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Swim off the sand at Marina di Ragusa and Punta Secca","type":"swim","detail":"The province beach strip is half an hour down from town, with a quiet dune reserve at the mouth of the Irminio in between.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":30,"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g1097285-Activities-Marina_di_Ragusa_Ragusa_Province_of_Ragusa_Sicily.html","https://www.turytrip.com/en/sicily-travel-blog/what-to-do-and-what-to-visit-in-ragusa-and-its-surroundings.html","https://ferrinihome.com/en/travel-notes/ragusa-and-surroundings-what-to-see-on-a-trip-around-the-sites-of-montalbano","https://www.thewomtravel.com/italy/sicily/ragusa/things-to-do-ragusa.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Scale del Gusto","type":"festival","detail":"An autumn tasting trail staged on the stairways between the two halves of the city, with producers, cooking sessions and talks.","season":[10],"evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":30,"urls":["https://www.charminly.com/festivals-and-typical-events-in-the-province-of-ragusa/","https://www.visitvigata.com/eventi/","https://www.risveglioibleo.com/index.php/14-generale/127-calendario-eventi"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Monte Racello","type":"activity","sources":["osm","wikidata","wikipedia"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":3,"sources":["osm","wikidata","wikipedia"]}},{"name":"alto corso del fiume Irmino","type":"activity","sources":["heritage","osm"],"evidence":{"method":"open","n_sources":2,"sources":["heritage","osm"]}}],"trips":[{"kind":"destination","id":"gem:modica","name":"Modica","country":"Italy","dist_km":8,"travel":{"minutes":18,"mode":"car","source":"trip_model"},"why":["editorialRoute"],"lat":36.86,"lon":14.76,"rating":{"score":7.3,"label":"Worth a visit"},"blurb":"Baroque c